<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18646" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχάρακτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not marked</i> or <i>branded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμηλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					13.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; <i>not stamped,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mitt.
				33.384
			</span></i> (Pergam.); of ships, <i>without emblem</i> or
				<i>figurehead,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLille
				22.6
			</span></i>; <i>not graven</i> or <i>cut,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				13.84
			</span></i>; <i>that cannot be cut,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδήρῳ γυῖα ἀ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				16.158
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				26.242
			</span></i>.</div>
